00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:06.340
Believe it or not, I want you to be okay. It has nothing to do with Arthur only because you're Vincent.

2
00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:10.700
All right, cut the crying. I hate weak women the most. Let's go home.

3
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:18.980
Oh, no wonder you're the future mistress of heart. Manne, such clever tricks.

4
00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:22.760
Even a temper like the young masters can be tamed by you.

5
00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:32.310
Sophia, Vincent is hurt. Can you go get the family doctor to check on him?

6
00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:37.190
Of course. I don't need a stranger like you to remind me. I grew up in this manner.

7
00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:40.030
I've been taking care of the young master longer than you've known him.

8
00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:45.990
Sophia, why do you always have so much hostility against me? We'll have to live together from now on.

9
00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:47.990
Hostility?

10
00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:51.390
I'm just a servant. I wouldn't dare. How could I offend you?

11
00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:55.070
You're so good at using that face to seduce and please men.

12
00:00:55.790 --> 00:00:59.250
Sophia, could it be you like Arthur?
